<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>We Value Your Feedback</title>
    <style>
      body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f6f8; font-family:
      'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333; } .container
      { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background-color: #fff;
      border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08); overflow:
      hidden; } .header { background-color: #0c4a6e; color: white; text-align:
      center; padding: 30px 20px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; } .body {
      padding: 30px 25px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; } .highlight {
      font-weight: bold; color: #0c4a6e; } .cta { text-align: center; margin:
      30px 0; } .cta a { background-color: #007bff; color: white;
      text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 26px; font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 6px; font-size: 16px; transition: background-color 0.3s
      ease; } .cta a:hover { background-color: #0056b3; } .footer {
      background-color: #f0f2f5; padding: 20px; text-align: center; font-size:
      13px; color: #777; border-top: 1px solid #e1e1e1; } .footer a { color:
      #0c4a6e; text-decoration: none; margin: 0 6px; } @media (max-width: 600px)
      { .body { padding: 20px 15px; } .header { font-size: 20px; padding: 20px
      15px; } .cta a { padding: 12px 20px; font-size: 15px; } }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='header'>
        💬 Help Us Improve EngageGPT
      </div>
      <div class='body'>
        <p>Hi <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>

        <p>We're always working to make
          <span class='highlight'>EngageGPT</span>
          more valuable for you.</p>

        <p>Your feedback helps us deliver better features, improve performance,
          and tailor the experience to your needs.</p>

        <p>We’d love to hear your thoughts in a quick 2-minute survey:</p>

        <div class='cta'>
          <a href='{{surveyLink}}' target='_blank'>Take the Survey</a>
        </div>

        <p>Thanks for being a part of our journey 🚀</p>
        <p>Warm regards,<br />The EngageGPT Team</p>
      </div>
      <div class='footer'>
        &copy;
        {{year}}
        EngageGPT. All rights reserved.<br />
        <a href='https://engagegpt.in'>Website</a>
        |
        <a href='mailto:engagegpt@gmail.com'>Support</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>